{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19647","headline":"终南精舍月中闻磬声诗 · 吕温","name":"终南精舍月中闻磬声诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月峰禅室掩，幽磬静昏氛。\n思入空门妙，声从觉路闻。\n泠泠满虚壑，杳杳出寒云。\n天籁疑难辨，霜钟谁可分。\n偶来游法界，便欲谢人羣。\n竟夕听真响，尘心自解纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}